OL,3,AWhat we know about the global Microsoft
OL,4,Aoutage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major global Microsoft outage has
OL,7,Fcaused problems, or in some cases
OL,8,Fdisabled entire services, including
OL,9,Femails and artificial intelligence
OL,10,Fproducts.
OL,12,FMicrosoft has said the outage was not
OL,13,Fcaused by a cyber-security incident,
OL,14,Fbut efforts to fix the issues have so
OL,15,Ffar been largely unsuccessful.
OL,17,FHere's what we know about the services
OL,18,Faffected and what went wrong.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
