OL,3,AGPs, police and pharmacies among UK
OL,4,Aservices affected by Microsoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it was working
OL,7,Fclosely with the firm to assess any
OL,8,Fimpact on its services, while local
OL,9,Fauthorities warned that some council
OL,10,Fservices were being affected.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
