OL,3,ACourts, spies and MPs: How the
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage has been felt around
OL,5,Athe world
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 74 countries have been
OL,8,Faffected by the Microsoft outage since
OL,9,Fit was detected after midday US Eastern
OL,10,FTime (17:00 GMT) on Thursday.
OL,12,FMicrosoft 365 Services, including
OL,13,FTeams, Outlook and artificial
OL,14,Fintelligence software Copilot, were
OL,15,Fexperiencing "connectivity problems",
OL,16,Fthe company said.
OL,18,FAs of 12:00 GMT on Friday, it reported
OL,19,Fseeing "encouraging recovery progress
OL,20,Fin Europe" while Japan remained
OL,21,F"comparatively more stable" and North
OL,22,FAmerica was "also improving".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
