OL,3,ATimothee Chalamet and Zendaya prank
OL,4,ARylan Clark for Children in Need
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year's Children in Need show will
OL,7,Falso feature Radio 2 presenter Owain
OL,8,FWyn Evans and a "challenge squad" of
OL,9,Fyoung people completing feats in the
OL,10,Fname of charity.
OL,12,FLast year's appeal raised more than
OL,13,F#45m to help children and young people
OL,14,Facross the UK, and this year's TV event
OL,15,Fwill be broadcast from 19:00 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
