OL,5,G1445 Life Without
OL,6,     FAlan Davies shuts down the Gulf
OL,7,     FStream, the Atlantic current that
OL,8,     Fmoves heat towards Northern
OL,9,     FEurope. What happens to sea
OL,10,     Flevels, the ocean's wildlife and
OL,11,     Fthe weather?
